        <style>
        @@media (min-width: 992px) {
            /* Design1 · DESKTOP ONLY (>=992px, the same breakpoint that reveals
               #divDesktopSideArea). On a wide/desktop browser window this modal was
               reported as showing like a bare full page with no way back. Rather than
               fight it back into a tiny centered dialog, we lean into that and make it
