               the same 480px app column (.wrapper) - so the decorative side panel
               stays visible exactly like every other screen - no dark backdrop behind
               it, and the small "x" restyled + reordered into an obvious round
               Back-arrow button (same fa-arrow-left convention as Design2/5's
               .back-btn) so there is always a clear way back to the menu. Mobile/narrow
               widths are untouched - Design1 keeps its normal centered popup there. */
            body.design1 #itemDetailModal .modal-dialog {
                max-width: 480px;
                width: 100%;
                height: 100%;
                min-height: 100vh;
                margin: 0;
            }

                body.design1 #itemDetailModal .modal-content {
                    height: 100%;
                    min-height: 100vh;
                    border: 0;
                    border-radius: 0;
                }

            body.design1.modal-open .modal-backdrop {
                display: none;
            }

            /* Back button: same DOM node as the close "x" (data-dismiss="modal"
               still dismisses the modal normally) - only re-skinned. Fixed-position
               (not just reordered inside the header) so it always floats on top of
               the header/image regardless of their stacking - it was getting hidden
               behind the item image before this. */
            body.design1 #itemDetailModal .modal-header {
                position: relative;
                padding-left: 66px;
            }

            body.design1 #itemDetailModal .modal-header .close {
                position: fixed;
                top: 20px;
                left: 20px;
                z-index: 10000;
                float: none;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                width: 40px;
                height: 40px;
                min-width: 40px;
                padding: 0;
                margin: 0;
                border-radius: 50%;
                background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
                box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
                opacity: 1;
                font-size: 0;
            }

                body.design1 #itemDetailModal .modal-header .close span {
                    display: none;
                }

                body.design1 #itemDetailModal .modal-header .close:before {
                    content: "\f060";
                    font-family: "FontAwesome";
                    font-size: 18px;
                    line-height: 1;
                    color: var(--popup_close_button_color, #000000);
                }
        }
        </style>
    }

